        "product_summary": "Wide toe-box winter ankle boots with a plush-lined interior and collar for seasonal casual-footwear assortments.\nDial-and-cord closure adjusts the upper without tying conventional laces; a heel pull tab provides a grip when putting the boot on.\nTPR outsole with a pronounced lug pattern, stitched side panels and an ankle-height silhouette.\nBlack and Gray, each in EU 39-48, give buyers two neutral color options and an extended men's size range.\nOriginal-style wholesale orders start from 2 pairs. Choose your color-size quantities to request an assortment quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
